diff --git a/docs/environment.md b/docs/environment.md
index 894b1300ef5eff3d1d5df9fc7f24e73f698a4738..b9c3312b3028baa59b4226a3ae516d7dca3a5c5a 100644
--- a/docs/environment.md
+++ b/docs/environment.md
@@ -43,6 +43,16 @@ Diagnostics quote and escape the supplied text so it cannot create another termi
 | `TF_DSPINE_WINDOW` | Qwen3.8-27B on CUDA with a DSpine `--drafter`: whole row count 16 through 8192 that narrows the drafter's sliding window; it must be at least the block (16) and at most the checkpoint's own `sliding_window`, else the drafter is refused when it opens; unset or blank keeps the checkpoint's (8192 for tencent/Qwen3.8-27B-DSpine-b16) |
 | `TF_DRAFT_NODES` | Whole native-size nonnegative count, capped by the drafter's window; zero disables trees |
 | `TF_QMMF_HALF_BELOW` | Whole native-size nonnegative block count; zero disables half tiles; default 96 |
+| `TF_HY4_MEM_FLOOR_GIB` | Whole GiB of MemAvailable below which `tf-hy4-cuda-generate`'s loader stops; default 10 |
+| `TF_HY4_FAST_PREFILL` | Exactly `0` or `1`; default `0`. `1` enables full-Hy4 fast prefill kernels and 2,048-row prompt chunks |
+| `TF_HY4_FAST_ROUTED` | Exactly `0` or `1`; default `1` when `TF_HY4_FAST_PREFILL=1`. `0` disables BM=64 fast routed prefill kernels |
+| `TF_HY4_FAST_MLA` | Exactly `0` or `1`; default `1` when `TF_HY4_FAST_PREFILL=1`. `0` disables Tensor-Core MLA prefill |
+| `TF_HY4_FAST_INDEXER` | Exactly `0` or `1`; default `1` when `TF_HY4_FAST_PREFILL=1`. `0` disables Tensor-Core token-indexer prefill |
+| `TF_HY4_PREFILL_AR` | Exactly `off`, `bf16`, or `fp32`; default `fp32` when `TF_HY4_FAST_PREFILL=1`, else `off`. Selects the TP=4 prefill ring collective |
+| `TF_HY4_FAST_PREFILL_MIN_ROWS` | Whole row count 64 through 4294967295; default `256`. Minimum rows to enter the fast prefill kernels |
+| `TF_HY4_PROMPT_ROWS` | Multiple of 64 from 64 through 4096; default `2048` when `TF_HY4_FAST_PREFILL=1`, else `1024`. Prompt chunk rows per pass |
+| `TF_HY4_PREFILL_TIMERS` | Exactly `0` or `1`; default `0`. `1` logs per-stage Hy4 prefill timings on rank 0 |
+| `TF_HY4_VISION_DIR` | A directory, index, or shard path without control characters holding Hy4 `vit.*` safetensors weights; unset or blank uses the model folder |
 | `TENSORFOLD_PROMPT_CACHE_KEEP_OTHERS` | Exactly `0` or `1`, checked when the CUDA backend starts; default off ([profiles](profiles.md)) |
 | `TF_PROMPT_INTERMEDIATE` | Exactly `0` or `1`, checked when the CUDA backend starts; default off. `1` keeps Flash Next's ladder of intermediate prompt-cache checkpoints under a long prompt's history |
 | `TENSORFOLD_LFM2_KV_PAGES` | Exactly `0` or `1`, checked when the CUDA backend starts; unset leases pool pages ([profiles](profiles.md)) |
